    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d964">

                <pb facs="0659" n="587" sameAs="frus:frus1865p4/pg587"/>

                <head>Official Song Union of Munsingen</head>
                <note rend="inline" rendition="#center" type="source">[Translation.]</note>
                <dateline>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Munsingen</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1865-05-06">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 6, 1865</date>.</dateline>
                <p>The members of the Official Song Union, amounting to one hundred and fifty in
                    number, met in Konalfingen on the 30th of April, 1865, and resolved as
                    follows:</p>
                <p>The undersigned declare their deep sympathy in the general sorrow, on account of
                    the atrocious assassination of President Abraham Lincoln, and cordialy rejoice
                    at the happy consequences of northern victories in the North American Union.</p>
                <p>They also request the proper execution of this resolution by the superior
                    authorities.</p>
                <p>In the name of the Union:</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>Z P. STÜNG, <lb/>
                                <hi rendition="#italic">Notary, President</hi>.</item>
                            <item>JACOB FISCHER, <lb/>
                                <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary</hi>.</item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
